<div xmlns:perseus="http://www.perseus.org/meta/perseus.rdfs#" xmlns:dctype="http://purl.org/dc/dcmitype/" xmlns:tufts="http://www.tufts.edu/" xmlns:alph="http://alpheios.net/namespaces/tei" class="alpheios-lex-text_container en">
    <div class="alpheios-lex-entry" lemma-id="n39749" body-key=""><b><span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἐπίκληρ-ος</span></b> , 
			Dor.
		
		<b><span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἐπικλήρ-κλᾱρος</span></b> , <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἡ ʽὁ</span> only in Thom.Mag.<i><span class="en">
			p.138R.
		</span></i>), <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense1"><b>A.</b><i>heiress</i>, <i><span class="en">
				Ar.
				<u>Av.</u>
				1653
			</span></i>, <i><span class="en">
				<u>V.</u>
				583
			</span></i>. <i><span class="en">
				And.
				1.121
			</span></i>, <i><span class="en">
				Lys.
				26.12
			</span></i>, <i><span class="en">
				Pl.
				<u>Lg.</u>
				630e
			</span></i>, <i><span class="en">
				Arist.
				<u>Ath.</u>
				9.2
			</span></i>, <i><span class="en">
				<u>Pol.</u>
				1270a27
			</span></i>, <i><span class="en">
				<u>IG</u>
				22.1165
			</span></i>, <i><span class="en">
				<u>Test.Epict.</u>
				3.31
			</span></i>, etc.; 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ὥσπερ ἐπικλήρου . . ἀμφις βητήσων
					ἥκει</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Lys.
					24.14
				</span></i>
			. </div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense3"><b>2.</b>. c. dat.,
				<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἐ. τῇ ἀρχῇ</span> (so codd.:
			prob. <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">τῆς ἀρχῆς</span>) <i>heiress
			to</i> the kingdom, <i><span class="en">
				D.H.
				1.70
			</span></i>: c. gen., 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἐ. οὐσίας μεγάλης</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Plu.
					<u>Cleom.</u>
					1
				</span></i>
			. </div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense3"><b>3.</b>. Astrol.,
			perh. 
				f.l. for
				<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἔγκληρος</span>
			, <i><span class="en">
				<u>Cat.Cod.Astr.</u>
				8(4).225
			</span></i>.</div>
